WEBVTT

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.352
Wh-What?

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.022
No...

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:24.859
Yuji, don't!

00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:51.218
Just this single Treasure

00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:54.138
prevents me from doing anything.

00:01:13.324 --> 00:01:16.952
<i>Now set free</i>

00:01:17.161 --> 00:01:23.334
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:27.213
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:33.260
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:01:33.469 --> 00:01:35.804
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:01:36.013 --> 00:01:38.432
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:40.976
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:01:41.185 --> 00:01:45.856
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:01:46.065 --> 00:01:48.400
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:01:48.609 --> 00:01:51.070
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:51.278 --> 00:01:53.697
<i>Your existence</i>

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:58.786
<i>Cry out</i>

00:01:58.994 --> 00:02:01.205
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.958
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:06.543
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:14.677
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:21.267
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:33.487
That is my proposed plan...

00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:36.156
An attack on the enemy's fortified positions,

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:39.493
and a counterattack to meet
them anywhere they strike us.

00:02:39.702 --> 00:02:43.038
These are the primary elements.

00:02:43.247 --> 00:02:46.333
It's quite a typical
strategy for a defensive battle.

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:48.919
Uninteresting.

00:02:49.128 --> 00:02:52.256
We outnumber them on a massive scale.

00:02:52.464 --> 00:02:54.133
Would it not be better to strike first,

00:02:54.341 --> 00:02:58.429
destroying them before
they come up with their own plan?

00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:04.393
After their defeat at Shanghai,

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:08.522
will the tools choose to regroup?

00:03:08.731 --> 00:03:11.400
Should they infiltrate
our territory in small numbers,

00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:13.569
we should appreciate their initiative,

00:03:13.777 --> 00:03:15.279
as we did during the Révolution.

00:03:15.487 --> 00:03:17.698
It's the opposite.

00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:20.075
They'll strengthen their defenses,

00:03:20.284 --> 00:03:22.077
precisely because of Shanghai.

00:03:22.286 --> 00:03:25.414
We are not their only enemies.

00:03:28.751 --> 00:03:30.252
As the General suggests,

00:03:30.461 --> 00:03:33.797
we cannot lose,
given our superior numbers.

00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:37.843
The Jéigers are prepared to scout the enemy.

00:03:38.886 --> 00:03:45.601
Our Strategist has already
foreseen such an obvious probability!

00:03:45.809 --> 00:03:47.478
Now, we must discuss

00:03:47.686 --> 00:03:50.939
how we respond in the
event of the unexpected--

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:52.733
I am present.

00:03:52.941 --> 00:03:54.610
We will be an immovable force.

00:03:54.818 --> 00:03:56.445
Impudence, Decarabia!

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:57.946
If you wish to speak before

00:03:58.155 --> 00:04:00.282
two of the Trinity, show yourself!

00:04:00.491 --> 00:04:02.951
I intended no discourtesy.

00:04:10.918 --> 00:04:13.754
Lady Bel-Peol,
Strategist and Judge of Paradoxes.

00:04:13.962 --> 00:04:16.256
Sir Sydonay, General
and the Thousand Changes.

00:04:16.465 --> 00:04:19.468
If I have unwittingly
given offense, I apologize.

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:20.594
How dare you?

00:04:20.803 --> 00:04:23.806
Stop it... We're in the midst of a meeting!

00:04:24.848 --> 00:04:29.228
Decarabia, pay more attention
to the actions of those around you.

00:04:29.436 --> 00:04:33.524
Do not delay our accomplishment of
the Grand Order with tiresome meddling.

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:36.568
Yes. I apologize.

00:04:47.496 --> 00:04:50.416
That got things warmed up.

00:04:50.624 --> 00:04:53.085
Begin the debate!

00:04:58.048 --> 00:05:00.926
"The Captive Flame Haze"

00:05:07.933 --> 00:05:09.768
Lady Shana.

00:05:11.061 --> 00:05:14.189
We have cleaned the room
and replaced your sheets.

00:05:14.398 --> 00:05:16.859
Do you require anything further?

00:05:19.695 --> 00:05:21.780
Then goodbye.

00:05:21.989 --> 00:05:24.241
Please summon us at any time.

00:05:27.369 --> 00:05:28.996
If I attacked them now,

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:32.791
even that Rinne could kill me.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.502
I don't have Nietono no Shana

00:05:35.711 --> 00:05:37.129
<i>or Master.</i>

00:05:39.465 --> 00:05:41.091
I'm alone.

00:06:58.377 --> 00:07:01.505
Someday, find it for yourself.

00:07:09.054 --> 00:07:10.472
<i>Shire...</i>

00:07:26.655 --> 00:07:30.200
She's become far more
accustomed to it, Sophie Sawallisch.

00:07:30.409 --> 00:07:32.995
Yes, Takemikazuchi.

00:07:33.203 --> 00:07:34.288
Her speed in learning is

00:07:34.496 --> 00:07:36.373
as expected from the
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:07:36.582 --> 00:07:38.125
I suppose.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:39.835
What's next?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:46.633
Then let us draft the letter
with the message to the Outlaws.

00:07:46.842 --> 00:07:47.926
I know...

00:07:48.135 --> 00:07:50.887
Why don't you write to
the Specialist of Everything?

00:07:51.096 --> 00:07:53.098
To Wilhelmina?

00:07:54.725 --> 00:07:56.143
No.

00:07:56.351 --> 00:07:58.729
If I send a message,
right after we said goodbye,

00:07:58.937 --> 00:08:00.522
I'll only disappoint her.

00:08:00.731 --> 00:08:03.692
A perfect Flame Haze
doesn't rely on anyone.

00:08:07.195 --> 00:08:09.281
You can't get to sleep yet?

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:12.743
L-I'm not lonely.

00:08:12.951 --> 00:08:16.204
I asked you to sleep with me.

00:08:16.413 --> 00:08:20.459
There's nothing for
you to be concerned about.

00:08:22.794 --> 00:08:25.922
Tomorrow will be
the last day I spend with you.

00:08:26.131 --> 00:08:28.342
I wouldn't call this a parting gift,

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:32.262
but I'd like you to remember something.

00:08:32.471 --> 00:08:36.308
When you deal with others,
choose but do not refuse.

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:37.851
No matter with whom you're dealing,

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:42.898
look first only at what
is before you, and then judge.

00:08:43.106 --> 00:08:44.608
If you notice something strange,

00:08:44.816 --> 00:08:47.277
face it, without running,
and then consider.

00:08:47.486 --> 00:08:50.489
Be it Flame Haze, Denizen, or human,

00:08:50.697 --> 00:08:52.407
investigate what you cannot understand.

00:08:52.616 --> 00:08:55.744
And if it brings you peace, hold on to it.

00:08:58.497 --> 00:08:59.748
Yes.

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:01.375
But...

00:09:02.626 --> 00:09:05.545
I won't cling to anyone.

00:09:05.754 --> 00:09:09.341
Because you're a perfect Flame Haze?

00:09:29.695 --> 00:09:30.696
Lady Shana.

00:09:30.904 --> 00:09:31.530
It's fine.

00:09:31.738 --> 00:09:33.573
I will enter alone.

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:36.201
Shana, I'm coming in.

00:09:39.121 --> 00:09:40.497
It's been a while.

00:09:40.706 --> 00:09:42.916
There's no need to glare like that.

00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:45.001
Tell her, Alastor.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:47.838
How dare you...

00:09:49.005 --> 00:09:50.298
<i>Master .</i>

00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:51.967
Have you been all right?

00:09:52.175 --> 00:09:53.635
Yes, mostly.

00:09:53.844 --> 00:09:55.929
Did they hurt you?

00:09:56.138 --> 00:09:57.764
Not at all.

00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:02.853
<i>Master is with me of his own accord.</i>

00:10:03.061 --> 00:10:04.688
If either of you wishes,

00:10:04.896 --> 00:10:07.774
the Cocytus can be
returned to you immediately.

00:10:07.983 --> 00:10:11.695
Alastor had no alternative
but to agree after what he heard.

00:10:13.613 --> 00:10:15.157
Flame of the Heavens,

00:10:15.365 --> 00:10:17.868
I offer you the opportunity

00:10:18.076 --> 00:10:20.996
to accompany me just once,
to gather information.

00:10:21.204 --> 00:10:22.748
Come with me.

00:10:22.956 --> 00:10:24.958
And see what I see,

00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:29.254
what the Ball Masque are.

00:10:30.714 --> 00:10:32.924
More importantly,
is anything else bothering you?

00:10:33.133 --> 00:10:34.551
I'm helpless.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.386
Remove this chain.

00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:38.263
I can't do that.

00:10:38.472 --> 00:10:40.724
There may be Denizens here

00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:44.186
who would see you injured.

00:10:44.394 --> 00:10:46.062
I can't have you roaming around.

00:10:46.271 --> 00:10:50.734
Then you shouldn't have
captured me in the first place!

00:10:50.942 --> 00:10:53.069
Would you prefer that
I either release you, or kill you?

00:10:53.278 --> 00:10:56.114
You would ask of me such a thing?

00:10:56.323 --> 00:11:00.035
You're always doing the craziest
things, completely straight-faced...

00:11:00.243 --> 00:11:01.870
Climbing from the terrace to the roof,

00:11:02.078 --> 00:11:04.790
before being dragged
back by Denizen guards.

00:11:04.998 --> 00:11:07.709
Or trying to sever your
chain with that decorative sword.

00:11:07.918 --> 00:11:11.254
I panicked when
I heard you'd hurt yourself.

00:11:16.176 --> 00:11:17.594
Shana.

00:11:21.431 --> 00:11:22.849
Shana“.

00:11:27.062 --> 00:11:29.314
No!

00:11:29.523 --> 00:11:30.690
Shana?

00:11:30.899 --> 00:11:32.526
What's wrong?!

00:11:33.735 --> 00:11:36.530
A single loss shouldn't
have affected you like this!

00:11:36.738 --> 00:11:37.072
$0 Why?

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.658
Stop it, Yuji Sakai.

00:11:39.866 --> 00:11:41.284
It can't be...

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:45.789
No, you wouldn't change your behavior
toward someone, based on their power!

00:11:45.997 --> 00:11:46.498
You would...

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:50.418
Don't talk like you understand me!

00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:00.846
My! my...

00:12:03.431 --> 00:12:08.645
I didn't expect to be met with
this pathetic scene upon arrival.

00:12:08.854 --> 00:12:10.438
This is someone I met yesterday,

00:12:10.647 --> 00:12:12.524
who is contributing toward the Grand Order.

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:14.484
Allow me to introduce you.

00:12:14.693 --> 00:12:16.278
Lamies, the Corpse Collector...

00:12:16.486 --> 00:12:19.489
Or Leanan Sidhe, the Spiral Organ.

00:12:19.698 --> 00:12:24.160
Fate brings us together
in the strangest places...

00:12:24.369 --> 00:12:28.123
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer, Shana.

00:12:44.306 --> 00:12:46.141
Shana-chan?

00:12:47.601 --> 00:12:50.270
Who is that?

00:12:54.316 --> 00:12:56.735
If they intended to annihilate her,

00:12:56.943 --> 00:13:00.322
their leader didn't need to come in person.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:05.535
So some kind of Unrestricted Method
must be sealing her power, indeed.

00:13:05.744 --> 00:13:08.747
Hence her bond with Yuji's mother...

00:13:08.955 --> 00:13:10.790
Complete isolation.

00:13:14.461 --> 00:13:17.881
Are you leaving to go somewhere?

00:13:18.089 --> 00:13:21.217
To receive all this, not being
able to give anything in return...

00:13:21.426 --> 00:13:22.677
Do not trouble yourself.

00:13:22.886 --> 00:13:25.680
You have been very good to me, indeed.

00:13:25.889 --> 00:13:29.851
If it's part of your job,
it can't be helped.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.145
Come back later,

00:13:32.354 --> 00:13:34.439
and see the baby's face.

00:13:39.653 --> 00:13:42.155
I told you to double check!

00:13:42.364 --> 00:13:45.867
We have no record of
any such person visiting us.

00:13:46.076 --> 00:13:48.578
Are you sure you haven't confused
us with another establishment?

00:13:48.787 --> 00:13:49.746
Please!

00:13:49.955 --> 00:13:51.498
Have someone look!

00:13:51.706 --> 00:13:54.501
Keisaku Sato must be there!

00:14:03.259 --> 00:14:05.887
What is that idiot doing?

00:14:06.096 --> 00:14:08.556
When he left, he was trying to act so cool.

00:14:09.349 --> 00:14:10.433
I'm coming in!

00:14:10.642 --> 00:14:12.268
Okay!

00:14:20.193 --> 00:14:22.612
Same time, every day. Good to see you.

00:14:22.821 --> 00:14:23.989
So, how'd it go?

00:14:24.197 --> 00:14:25.615
No good.

00:14:25.824 --> 00:14:27.701
They kept repeating the same thing.

00:14:27.909 --> 00:14:29.995
Finally, they hung up on me.

00:14:31.162 --> 00:14:33.456
Sucks to be you!

00:14:33.665 --> 00:14:35.542
No change, huh?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:36.418
Yeah...

00:14:36.626 --> 00:14:39.754
I was hoping that today our
sleeping beauty here would maybe...

00:14:39.963 --> 00:14:41.965
But she shows no signs of waking.

00:14:42.173 --> 00:14:44.092
I don't get it...

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.302
ls Sato really at that Outlaw branch?

00:14:46.511 --> 00:14:48.596
Isn't that what the
Specialist of Everything said?

00:14:48.805 --> 00:14:51.307
If they weren't sure,
they'd have explained.

00:14:51.516 --> 00:14:53.143
And they're playing dumb.

00:14:53.351 --> 00:14:55.729
They're hiding something.

00:14:55.937 --> 00:14:57.856
What's the point?

00:14:59.315 --> 00:15:02.360
Is Sato worth all that?

00:15:02.569 --> 00:15:04.946
Just calling isn't enough.

00:15:05.155 --> 00:15:08.074
We'll ask Carmel-sen to go directly.

00:15:08.867 --> 00:15:10.493
Maybe they...

00:15:12.078 --> 00:15:13.747
Could that be it?

00:15:13.955 --> 00:15:15.582
What do you mean?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:21.004
Well, there's this giant battle coming,
and the Specialist of Everything

00:15:21.212 --> 00:15:25.383
is completely ignoring her summons.

00:15:25.592 --> 00:15:29.637
She's ignoring direct requests
from the Braider of Trembling Might,

00:15:29.846 --> 00:15:31.765
Sophie Sawallisch, too.

00:15:32.474 --> 00:15:34.476
This isn't about Sato?

00:15:34.684 --> 00:15:36.102
Just listen...

00:15:36.311 --> 00:15:39.022
Basically, the guys at the
Tokyo headquarters are waiting

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.191
for the Specialist of Everything to arrive.

00:15:41.399 --> 00:15:45.779
And they plan to try persuading her then.

00:15:45.987 --> 00:15:48.448
Keisaku is a hostage to that cause.

00:15:48.656 --> 00:15:49.574
A hostage?

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:52.952
Flame Hazes don't always work well together.

00:15:53.161 --> 00:15:55.997
Often, there are plots or
trades happening behind the scenes.

00:15:56.206 --> 00:15:59.459
But Keisaku knew what he
was doing when he got involved.

00:16:01.669 --> 00:16:06.925
Hey, if Sato returns, she'll wake up, right?

00:16:07.133 --> 00:16:08.093
Dunno!

00:16:08.301 --> 00:16:09.260
First, we should see

00:16:09.469 --> 00:16:12.180
how she responds to the
passionate kiss of a prince!

00:16:12.388 --> 00:16:14.682
If the prince knew what was going on here,

00:16:14.891 --> 00:16:18.978
he'd return, even if he had to beat
the crap out of a legion of Flame Hazes!

00:16:19.187 --> 00:16:21.606
But sometimes, things just don't work out...

00:16:21.815 --> 00:16:25.485
If he knew Margery-san was
asleep in his room,

00:16:25.693 --> 00:16:27.612
he'd be here in a second.

00:16:27.821 --> 00:16:29.322
Damn right.

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:34.494
Sheesh...

00:16:34.702 --> 00:16:37.789
Just get back here, you idiot!

00:16:42.669 --> 00:16:43.962
I knew it.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:49.592
In this situation, I can't expect
any help from Hildegard, indeed.

00:16:49.801 --> 00:16:51.594
Personnel shortage.

00:16:51.803 --> 00:16:56.808
I know that, but I relied on my
friendship with them, to garner aid, indeed.

00:16:57.016 --> 00:16:58.852
I should have expected that

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:04.440
all requests for help with
this mad plan would be refused.

00:17:04.649 --> 00:17:07.944
I have but one thing on which to rely...

00:17:08.153 --> 00:17:11.656
The words of their creator, Gavida,
the Soaring Tower of Quintessence.

00:17:11.865 --> 00:17:13.449
"Palace of Heaven's Road
and Palace of the Stars

00:17:13.658 --> 00:17:15.827
must not be allowed
in proximity to one another."

00:17:16.035 --> 00:17:21.499
If I wait, the slim odds of
victory become even slimmer.

00:17:21.708 --> 00:17:26.004
I must leave within the next few days, indeed.

00:17:26.212 --> 00:17:28.131
Solemn departure.

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:34.721
If only Margery Daw were well...

00:17:40.476 --> 00:17:42.770
Where did I put my bag?

00:17:42.979 --> 00:17:44.606
Your back.

00:17:53.239 --> 00:17:57.452
I wonder if the baby is a boy or a girl.

00:17:58.912 --> 00:17:59.954
BeLPeoL

00:18:00.163 --> 00:18:01.289
regarding the master...

00:18:01.497 --> 00:18:04.918
Stolas has already explained it, yes?

00:18:05.126 --> 00:18:10.381
Right now, nothing could stop
completion of the Grand Order.

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:14.802
This is too important
to settle for "right now."

00:18:15.011 --> 00:18:17.680
I'll have Decarabia's guest brought in

00:18:17.889 --> 00:18:19.557
to investigate.

00:18:19.766 --> 00:18:21.601
The Spiral Organ?

00:18:21.809 --> 00:18:23.186
Indeed, perhaps they can...

00:18:23.394 --> 00:18:28.107
If that Mystes had any plan
to interfere with the Grand Order,

00:18:28.316 --> 00:18:30.526
the master would stop him.

00:18:30.735 --> 00:18:35.615
But the lack of communication
makes me a bit ill at ease.

00:18:35.823 --> 00:18:38.534
I suppose it is out of our hands...

00:18:40.662 --> 00:18:45.500
Then what is the master doing
when he skips his strategy conferences?

00:18:47.043 --> 00:18:48.836
Don't worry.

00:18:49.045 --> 00:18:52.048
Hecate is calculating the final coordinates.

00:18:52.257 --> 00:18:54.884
She isn't with our lord.

00:18:55.093 --> 00:18:57.178
To her, all this means nothing

00:18:57.387 --> 00:19:01.140
beyond another step toward
the Grand Order's completion.

00:19:01.349 --> 00:19:05.853
And a mere vessel will
never draw away her attention.

00:19:07.397 --> 00:19:09.941
The strategy conferences took a long time.

00:19:10.149 --> 00:19:14.237
Yes, this involves more manpower
and territory than any other attack in history.

00:19:14.445 --> 00:19:17.365
There are a million points to argue over.

00:19:17.573 --> 00:19:19.617
Each of them is a veteran

00:19:19.826 --> 00:19:23.663
of group combat, with several
hundred years of experience.

00:19:23.871 --> 00:19:27.625
Even with this large a scale,
if they work together, they'll be fine.

00:19:27.834 --> 00:19:30.712
Hence Decarabia's withdrawal.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.549
So the preparations are complete?

00:19:34.757 --> 00:19:36.592
Connect us to the professor.

00:19:36.801 --> 00:19:38.219
Yes.

00:19:43.683 --> 00:19:45.143
Can you hear me?

00:19:45.351 --> 00:19:46.686
Yes!

00:19:46.894 --> 00:19:48.438
Bottom of the engine room here.

00:19:48.646 --> 00:19:52.275
Ask the professor how much he's completed.

00:19:52.483 --> 00:19:52.942
All right.

00:19:53.151 --> 00:19:54.360
Professor!

00:19:54.569 --> 00:19:57.572
The Strategist wishes to
know how much work is finished...

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.449
Domino!

00:19:59.657 --> 00:20:02.160
Why aren't you working?!

00:20:02.368 --> 00:20:05.830
Strategist!

00:20:06.039 --> 00:20:08.291
What is it, Bel-Peol?

00:20:08.499 --> 00:20:17.508
Better than anyone else,
you know how busy I am...

00:20:17.717 --> 00:20:21.596
Hecate is adjusting the final coordinates.

00:20:24.849 --> 00:20:27.435
You need to finish up,

00:20:27.643 --> 00:20:31.564
as it will soon be time for the
Grand Order's second stage to activate.

00:20:31.773 --> 00:20:37.487
All second stage preparations
were completed ages ago!

00:20:37.695 --> 00:20:42.617
Currently, I'm working on a failsafe--

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.414
Eight promises were made.

00:20:48.623 --> 00:20:51.709
My work is done.

00:20:51.918 --> 00:20:55.880
May I now be allowed to
return to my job as a servant,

00:20:56.089 --> 00:21:00.218
my lovely Supreme Throne, Hecate?

00:21:00.426 --> 00:21:03.679
So you were unable to stop smoking.

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:05.681
Yes...

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:08.684
And I am not yours.

00:21:08.893 --> 00:21:10.478
That's too bad.

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:14.899
It has never been for me to allow.

00:21:15.108 --> 00:21:19.237
Welcome back, General.

00:21:19.445 --> 00:21:24.784
All that remains is to work together,
to bring about the Grand Order.

00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:35.753
He becomes bold in front of her...

00:21:35.962 --> 00:21:38.131
What are you saying?

00:21:38.339 --> 00:21:40.174
It's nothing.

00:21:57.817 --> 00:22:00.778
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:00.987 --> 00:22:04.365
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.574 --> 00:22:07.535
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.743 --> 00:22:13.499
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.708 --> 00:22:14.792
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.001 --> 00:22:18.087
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.296 --> 00:22:21.424
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.632 --> 00:22:24.844
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.052 --> 00:22:28.222
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.431 --> 00:22:31.559
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:31.767 --> 00:22:34.937
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.146 --> 00:22:38.858
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.066 --> 00:22:41.777
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:41.986 --> 00:22:48.326
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.534 --> 00:22:50.036
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.244 --> 00:22:51.287
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.496 --> 00:22:53.247
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.456 --> 00:22:56.876
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.084 --> 00:23:00.213
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.421 --> 00:23:03.633
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:03.841 --> 00:23:06.677
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:10.431
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.559
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:13.768 --> 00:23:22.276
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:25.696 --> 00:23:29.116
Sato is greeted violently at the Outlaw.

00:23:29.325 --> 00:23:30.868
Which Flame Haze appears before him,

00:23:31.077 --> 00:23:34.205
while he worries, uncertain of
what is happening in Misaki City?

00:23:34.413 --> 00:23:36.958
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:37.166 --> 00:23:39.460
"In Your Hand."
